00:09:41.967 --> 00:09:44.490
"MMR vaccine causes," no.

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:45.323
It doesn't.

00:09:45.323 --> 00:09:46.860
And that's not what the court confirmed.

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:51.300
In fact, just today, there was
a medical article published

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:53.569
from The Journal of American
Medical Association,

00:09:53.569 --> 00:09:56.549
they looked at five countries,
2,000,000 participants,

00:09:56.549 --> 00:09:59.830
they found 22,000 of them who
were diagnosed with autism,

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:00.970
which is one in 90,

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:05.440
and they found that 80% of the
autism cases were inherited.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:08.570
That means not due to
vaccinations or anything external.

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:10.245
That's so important to talk about

00:10:10.245 --> 00:10:11.838
'cause those who are anti-vaccine

00:10:11.838 --> 00:10:13.856
will hijack some of this misinformation

00:10:13.856 --> 00:10:15.658
and try to convince you their points

00:10:15.658 --> 00:10:18.343
to scare you away from
vaccines unnecessarily.

00:10:18.343 --> 00:10:20.210
This is about the truth

00:10:20.210 --> 00:10:22.287
and if we're trying to do
the best for our patients,

00:10:22.287 --> 00:10:26.015
we can't just go off of unproven
hypotheses and theories,

00:10:26.015 --> 00:10:27.546
we need to look at the evidence,

00:10:27.546 --> 00:10:30.129
and there's been a study
of 600,000 children

00:10:30.129 --> 00:10:33.220
who've been vaccinated,
no link with autism found.

00:10:33.220 --> 00:10:34.700
This study with millions of people

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.684
finding that autism, 80% of
the time is mainly inherited,

00:10:37.684 --> 00:10:39.680
these are important things to look at.

00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:43.470
Please do not fall for the misinformation

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:44.897
that comes from a lot of these

00:10:44.897 --> 00:10:46.597
"natural" sources on Facebook.

00:10:46.597 --> 00:10:48.109
